OL,3,ATrump sued over Canadian tariffs in
OL,4,Alatest legal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump is facing
OL,7,Fanother legal challenge on tariffs
OL,8,Fafter the group that successfully sued
OL,9,Fover his so-called "liberation day"
OL,10,Fimport taxes filed a new lawsuit over
OL,11,Fthe latest Canadian levies.
OL,13,FThe White House imposed a 50% levy on
OL,14,Fsome $20bn of Canadian goods after
OL,15,Ftrade talks between the US and Canada
OL,16,Fbroke down in August.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
