OL,3,ATrump sued over Canadian tariffs in
OL,4,Alatest legal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liberty Justice Center filed a suit
OL,7,Fon behalf of US food business Gellert
OL,8,FGlobal Group, urging the US Court of
OL,9,FInternational Trade to find the levies
OL,10,Funlawful and to order refunds with
OL,11,Finterest for affected importers.
OL,13,FThe lawsuit argues the White House
OL,14,Fexceeded its authority in imposing the
OL,15,Ftariffs and caused "immediate harm to
OL,16,FAmerican businesses".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
